      "body": "# Finding description and impact\n\nRoot Cause: The vulnerability exists in the yield calculation logic within the distributeRewards() function in Distributor.sol (approximately line 390). The contract performs an unchecked arithmetic subtraction without protecting against underflow:\n\n```sol\nuint256 balance_ = IERC20(yieldToken_).balanceOf(address(this));\nuint256 underlyingYield_ = (balance_ - depositPool.lastUnderlyingBalance).to18(decimals_)\n```\n\nWhen balance_ is less than depositPool.lastUnderlyingBalance, this calculation triggers an integer underflow. Since Solidity 0.8+ has built-in overflow protection, the transaction automatically reverts with panic code 0x11.\n\n## Impact\n\n* Complete Protocol DOS: The vulnerability causes total failure of the reward distribution system, affecting all users regardless of their permissions or stake amounts.\n\n* Persistent Failure State: Once triggered, the condition persists indefinitely. Every subsequent call to distributeRewards() will fail until manual intervention occurs.\n\n* Natural Trigger Scenarios: The underflow can occur through common DeFi mechanisms including:\n\n* AAVE slashing events where aTokens lose value due to protocol penalties\n\n* Token fees charged on transfers or holdings\n\n* Deflationary token mechanics that reduce supply\n\n* Liquidation events that reduce held balances\n\n* Protocol upgrades affecting token balances\n\n## Recommended mitigation steps\n\nImplement conditional underflow protection in the yield calculation:\n\n```sol\nfunction distributeRewards(uint256 rewardPoolIndex_) external {\n    // ... existing validation logic ...\n    \n    for (uint256 i = 0; i < length_; i++) {\n        DepositPool storage pool = depositPools[rewardPoolIndex_][depositPoolAddresses[rewardPoolIndex_][i]];\n        address yieldToken = pool.aToken;\n        uint256 balance_ = IERC20(yieldToken).balanceOf(address(this));\n        uint8 decimals_ = IERC20Metadata(yieldToken).decimals();\n        \n        uint256 underlyingYield_;\n        // CRITICAL FIX: Add underflow protection\n        if (balance_ >= pool.lastUnderlyingBalance) {\n            underlyingYield_ = (balance_ - pool.lastUnderlyingBalance).to18(decimals_);\n        } else {\n            // Handle deficit gracefully\n            underlyingYield_ = 0;\n            // Track deficit for monitoring\n            uint256 deficit = (pool.lastUnderlyingBalance - balance_).to18(decimals_);\n            emit DeficitDetected(depositPoolAddresses[rewardPoolIndex_][i], deficit);\n        }\n        \n        uint256 yield_ = underlyingYield_ * pool.tokenPrice;\n        // IMPORTANT: Always update to current balance\n        pool.lastUnderlyingBalance = balance_;\n        yields_[i] = yield_;\n        totalYield_ += yield_;\n    }\n    // ... rest of function ...\n}\n```",
